[2026-02-02T19:46:30.757+0000] {docker.py:429} INFO - 2026-02-02 19:46:30 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.perugiatoday.it/eventi/perugia-giornate-del-bartoccio-programma-eventi-2026.html>
{'category': [],
 'city': 'Perugia',
