[2026-02-02T19:46:33.482+0000] {docker.py:429} INFO - 2026-02-02 19:46:33 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.perugiatoday.it/eventi/gino-cecchettin-a-perugia.html>
{'category': ['Incontri'],
 'city': 'Perugia',
